SUMMARY:Accepting Submissions: Poetry on Display
DESCRIPTION:Submit your poetry to be featured in the East Regional 
 Library's National Poetry Month display!\n\nChildren\, Teens\, and Adults 
 from Durham and the surrounding community are invited to submit up to two 
 poems to be displayed. Community poems will be displayed throughout the 
 library from April 2026-April 2027.\n\nGuidelines:\n\n\n	Poems must be 
 submitted by Friday\, March 27\, 2026 \n	Up to two poems per person will be 
 accepted \n	Please include your name on your submission\, unless you'd like 
 to remain anonymous\n	Kindly keep each poem limited to one page\n	Please 
 keep your submissions family friendly\; the library will not display adult 
 themes or poetry using adult language\n\n\nQuestions and completed poems 
 can be emailed to Mara Plantholt at: mplantholt@dconc.gov\n
LOCATION:East Regional Library (211 Lick Creek Lane)
ORGANIZER;CN="Mara Plantholt":MAILTO:mplantholt@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Writing
UID:LibCal-14288-16458997
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16458997
END:VEVENT
