SUMMARY:Experience to Enterprise
DESCRIPTION:Workshop designed to help participants explore practical\, 
 easy-to-start business options supported by community-based resources. The 
 session highlights low-cost business models\, realistic startup pathways\, 
 and local support systems that help reduce barriers and build confidence. 
 Participants leave with clear options\, informed next steps\, and 
 connections to Durham and Triangle-area resources that support long-term 
 business ownership and economic stability.
