SUMMARY:HEAD 2 HEAD: Kidz Movie Poll
DESCRIPTION:It's time to vote!! A kid's voting station has been set up in 
 the children's area at the South Regional Library.\n\nWhat is your favorite 
 version of Snow White? Is it the animated Disney movie (1937) or the Disney 
 live action film (2025)? Let us know!\n\nThe winning movie will be selected 
