 contest open to all Durham students in grades K through 8 (public\, 
 private\, and home schools).Come to the library this week April 1st and 2nd 
 to create your own poster! The water efficiency experts will be present to 
 help provide inspiration and ideas for your poster! All materials are 
 provided.
