SUMMARY:The GREAT EGG HUNT
DESCRIPTION:Join us for EGG-CEPTIONALLY Egg fun as we decorate our egg 
 collection bags and take off for the great outdoors (weather permitting 
 otherwise indoors) to locate hidden eggs. Found eggs can then be turned in 
 for prizes\, stickers\, tattoos\, or candy! Please REGISTER so we know how 
 many are coming! The fun should be really EGG-CITING for the entire family.
LOCATION:South Meeting Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Joel White":MAILTO:jwhite@dconc.gov
