 materials to celebrate this year's "Stories that Built US" LibraryFest 
 theme with tools to write your own stories\, including wooden storytelling 
 tiles\, a small journal\, and more! Resources\, information\, and links 
 about writing both fiction and nonfiction also included.\n\nKits are 
 located in the shelving unit outside of the Innovation Lab on the Third 
 Floor at Main Library for you to take home and complete.\n\nFirst come\, 
 first serve while supplies last.
