DESCRIPTION:Refresh your child’s wardrobe and toy shelf without spending 
 a dime! Join us for a community Children’s Clothing & Toy Swap\, 
 organized by the Durham Mothers Club. Each participant may fill one bag 
 with gently used children’s & maternity clothes and/or toys to take 
