SUMMARY:Durham Board of Elections NC Voter Photo ID Event
DESCRIPTION:Stop by the MakerLab on the first floor of the Main Library 
 located at 300 North Roxboro Street to learn more about the photo ID 
 requirements for voting in North Carolina. Ask questions\, register to 
 vote\, and receive a free NC Voter Identification Card!\n\nFor more 
 information please visit https://www.dcovotes.dconc.gov/\n\nParking is 
 available in the library parking lot or at the North Queen Street Garage 
 located at 115 North Queen Street which is behind the apartments directly 
 across the street from the library. Parking at the garage is free. Please 
 bring your parking ticket to a service point for validation.
LOCATION:MakerLab\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
