DTSTAMP:20260412T000000Z
SUMMARY:Roaming Readers: A Walking Audiobook Club!
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we walk the trails of RTP while listening to 
 audiobooks! After\, feel free to join us at Drift Coffee Shop & Kitchen RTP 
 for an optional discussion about the book and a chance to meet new people. 
 \n\n \n\nThis month’s suggested audiobook is You Deserve to Know by Aggie 
 Blum Thompson (available on Libby). If you have already read it\, or would 
 prefer another title\, we suggest: You Shouldn’t Have Come Here by Jeneva 
 Rose (available on Hoopla) or The Locked Door by Freida McFadden (available 
 on Libby). \n\n \n\nThis event is for book lovers\, the book-curious\, 
 people who haven’t been able to make time to read (or listen) for fun\, 
 introverts\, extroverts\, exercisers\, caregivers pushing strollers\, 
 (leashed) dog owners\, groups\, singles\, nature lovers\, and 
 multi-taskers!\n\n \n\nAll paces welcome\, please take breaks when you need 
 them. We know it is easy to get transported to another world when listening 
 to your book. Be sure to stay alert as we will be crossing roads and may 
 encounter uneven pavement. \n\n \n\nWhile attendance is free\, please 
 register to receive reminders and stay in the know for any updates. Free 
 public parking is located on the deck just across the street at 3150 Elion 
 Drive. We will meet at 3151 Elion Drive Durham\, NC 27713.\n\n 
 \n\nQuestions? Email Elle at kfarmer@dconc.gov.\n\n \n\nUpcoming 
 dates:\n\nMay 3rd\n\nJune 7th\n\nJuly 12th\n\nAugust 9th\n\nSeptember 13th
LOCATION:Offsite
ORGANIZER;CN="Elle F.":MAILTO:kfarmer@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Book Club, Health & Fitness, Social
UID:LibCal-14288-16543354
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16543354
END:VEVENT
