SUMMARY:Dog Appreciation Month Scavenger Hunt @ Southwest Regional
DESCRIPTION:For April’s scavenger hunt\, we’ve hidden pictures of 10 
 dogs throughout the children’s area of the library (in honor of Dog 
 Appreciation Month)... Can you find them all?!\n\nThis scavenger hunt will 
