SUMMARY:Bookmobile Stop: The Scrap Exchange Everyday is EarthDay 2026!
DESCRIPTION:The Bookmobile will be at the Scrap Exchange on Saturday from 
 1:00 - 5:00 pm.\n\nWe’re so excited to be a part of Everyday is EarthDay 
 2026! The event will be on April 18th from 1-5pm here at The Scrap for an 
 afternoon of building community\, spreading joy\, and giving our planet 
 (and Mongo!) some love as we celebrate 35 years of The Scrap Exchange. 
 \n\nVisit the Bookmobile and complete a small craft. No registration 
 required!\n\nThe Scrap Exchange\n\n2050 Chapel Hill Rd\, Durham\, 
 27707\n\nInformation about our Bookmobile: \n\nOur library-on-wheels serves 
 local neighborhoods\, shopping centers\, and other community locations. 
 We're open to all so check out our schedule to visit any of our many stops 
 throughout Durham County. We have titles for children\, teens\, and 
 adults\, in both English and Spanish. See our full bookmobile schedule 
 here. \n\n*This schedule is subject to change without notice due to 
 weather\, traffic\, or mechanical difficulties.
