SUMMARY:Preschool STEAM Storytime: Let's Learn About Airplanes!
DESCRIPTION:Preschoolers (ages 3-5 years) and their caregivers are welcome 
 to join Ms. Natalie for a STEAM (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, 
 Arts\, and Mathematics) storytime! On the 1st and 3rd Monday of every 
 month\, we will explore a different STEAM topic with stories\, songs\, and 
 a hands-on activity.\n\nThis week\, we will learn all about airplanes (and 
 their history) and create our own airplanes using paper\, crayons\, and 
 markers!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have any questions\, please 
 contact us @ 919-560-8592.\n\n
